 2a.jpg
DESCRIPTION:At Laugh It Off\, stand-up comedian Andrew Packer teams up wit
 h his real-life dad\, Jeff Packer\, an actual therapist with over 35 years
  experience\, for a comedy show like no other.\nAudience members anonymous
 ly submit a real struggle/grievance from their life that they want to "lau
 gh off". Then\, Andrew and a lineup of comedians turn those real-life topi
 cs into laughs\, while his dad offers heartfelt insight from a therapist
 ’s perspective on stage.\nIt’s raw\, real\, and ridiculously funny—p
 art stand-up\, part therapy and incredibly entertaining.\nAndrew Packer is
  most well known for his stand out performance on the hit show KILL TONY a
 nd for MAN NEWS\; his comedy news series that has attracted over 1.2 milli
 on subscribers and over one billion views on Youtube. On stage\, Andrew ha
 s headlined in over 15 countries\, with highlight performances on Netflix 
 is a Joke Radio\, Just For Laughs Festival and the Edinburgh International
  Fringe Festival. His debut comedy special 'On Guard' is available now on 
 Youtube\, released with 800 Pound Gorilla Media\, totalling over 100\,000 
 views in its first year. And his next special ‘Never Call Her Crazy’\,
  is scheduled for release by Dry Bar Comedy in mid 2026.\n$25 online\, $30
  at the door
LOCATION:Comedy Bar
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/laugh-it-off-toronto-2/
