  is perfect for textile artists of all backgrounds and skill levels. We’
 re talking quilters\, darners\, costume enthusiasts\, dabblers\, crafters\
 , and all our east end neighbours! The warm summer season is just around t
 he corner\, so this is the perfect opportunity to pick up some materials t
