 s relaxed\, hands-on workshop designed for beginners.\nYou’ll learn the 
 fundamentals of weaving on a 10 × 15” frame lap loom\, including how to
  warp your loom\, weave basic stitches such as plain weave\, soumak\, and 
 rya knots\, add fringe\, properly finish your piece\, and weave in loose e
 nds on the back before removing it from the loom.\nAll materials are provi
 ded\, including a curated selection of yarns. You’ll go home with your c
 ompleted wall hanging and the loom and tools are yours to keep for future 
