BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Master the Art of Calm within the CHaOs
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260418T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260418T154500
UID:blogto-233507@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/12/original_image9e1682eb-da1c-4afa-b6b1-55ac4886b0
 1c.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Details and tickets: https://www.know-yourself.ca\nTry Practic
 al Stoic Philosophy – Cultivate Strength\, Serenity and Service!\nWe liv
 e in a time of great opportunity – but also constant noise and distracti
 on.\nThere is more access than ever before to knowledge\, connection\, and
  possibilities for growth. Yet many of us feel pulled in too many directio
 ns: endless notifications\, constant novelty\, superficial trends and pres
 sure to keep up. Attention is scattered. Depth is easily lost.\nLife also 
 brings unexpected inner struggles\, relationship challenges\, and moments 
 that ask more of us than we feel ready to give. Beyond our personal lives\
 , we also witness a world shaped by uncertainty\, rapid change\, violence\
 , anxiety\, and division.\nHow can we remain steady\, joyful\, and purpose
 ful in the middle of it all?\nMaster the Art of Calm Within the Chaos is a
  practical and inspiring workshop to help us discover how ancient Stoic ph
 ilosophy can help us live our modern life with greater clarity\, joy\, res
 ilience and purpose.\nAt its heart\, Stoicism is not about becoming cold o
 r detached. It is a spiritual philosophy of discovering the laws of life a
 nd living in harmony with them. It invites us to cultivate character\, bec
 ome calm within\, and act with wisdom so we can all serve the common good.
 \nThrough a thought-provoking talk\, guided reflection\, and engaging disc
 ussion\, you will explore real-life situations and gain insights and pract
 ical tools to navigate the challenges of daily life.\nIn this workshop\, w
 e will explore:\n• How and Why to remain calm within the chaos\n• The 
 role of obstacles in daily life\n• How to build inner strength without l
 osing compassion\n• How to rise above distraction\, superficiality\, and
  reactive living\n• How to develop clarity\, purpose and resilience\n•
  How to serve family\, community and society more wisely\n• How to live 
 as a responsible and courageous citizen\nIf you feel called to live with g
 reater depth\, strength\, and peace in a chaotic world\, this workshop is 
 for you.\nCome discover how calm becomes strength\, strength becomes servi
 ce\, and philosophy becomes a way of life!\nWe look forward to meeting you
 \,\nVolunteers of New Acropolis Toronto
LOCATION:Centre for Social Innovation
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/master-the-art-of-calm-within-the-chaos-
 toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
