 b6.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join hosts Raymond Helkio and Jonathan Freeman for sassy poetr
 y\, performance\, literature and libations!  This month our featured art
 ists starts with the infamous bill bissett with Lothar Bahr + poet and aut
 hor Drew McEwan!\nThis is an all-ages\, licensed PWYC event\, allies alway
 s welcome! Open mic slots are 3 minutes and if you’d like to read please
  sign-up at the door.\nDOORS + SIGN-UP 4:00 PM\nShowtime 4:30 PM\nBuddies 
 is a fully accessible venue with barrier-free\, gender-neutral washrooms. 
 Thank you to the kick-ass staff at Buddies In Bad Times Theatre\, Tallulah
 's Cabaret\, and The Reading Salon.\nMORE INFO:  https://raymondhelkio.c
 om/poetry-open-mic\nhttps://www.facebook.com/groups/809670790166270\nhttps
