 ey face in urban environments like Toronto. Supporting the human experts i
 n teaching us will be three live birds of prey!\nAfter the presentation\, 
 the Nature Centre team will lead a 45-minute hike through High Park uncove
 ring the familial connections of the raptors in the park.\nYou can choose 
 to register for one of our three sessions:\nSession 1: 12-1:45PM\nSession 
 2: 1:30-3:15PM (*Kid-friendly)\nSession 3: 3-4:45PM\nPrice: $20 ($15 for c
