DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260419T160000
UID:blogto-233114@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/03/original_imageef6394a0-0e5a-43a1-8958-7f481a6f39
 47.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Menopause is one of the biggest transitions in a woman’s lif
 e\, yet most of us receive very little guidance about what’s actually ha
 ppening in our bodies. This event brings together expert insight\, movemen
 t\, and community to help women better understand and support their health
  during midlife.\nIncludes a menopause expert talk\, pelvic floor educatio
