 gto.com/events/2026/04/12/original_imageca2b2e10-3884-4e9e-9e18-c2c9ed60fb
 b6.jpg
DESCRIPTION:✨ MONDAY NIGHT LIVE ✨\nGINA P • SELANA EVANGELINE • MI
 CHAEL SHAND\nToronto\, Monday nights just got serious 🎤\nIf you’ve be
 en craving real vocals\, live instruments\, and that intimate\, goosebump 
 kind of vibe—this is your night.\nAt The Real Jerk Restaurant\, we’re 
 bringing you a live music experience where the room gets quiet for the voc
 als… then loud for the energy.\n✨ Gina P – Vocals\nBig voice. Soulfu
 l delivery. The kind of performance that stops conversations mid-sentence\
 n✨ Selana Evangeline – Vocals & Guitar\nSmooth\, rich\, and effortless
 —acoustic vibes that pull you in and hold you there\n✨ Michael Shand 
