  to every track\n🗓 Monday Night\n⏰ 7:00 PM Showtime\n📍 The Real Je
 rk Restaurant\n842 Gerrard St East\, Toronto\n📞 416-463-6055\n✨ Irie 
 Hour 4–7 PM – ease in with drinks and good company before showtime\n
