DESCRIPTION:We've noticed that people want to read more books\, be social\
 , and get out of the house. Join Quiet Smile at Wildhearts Cafe for a Quie
 t Offline Reading Party\, with an optional book swap.\nLeave your phone ou
 t of reach. Quiet reading time in a room with other people doing the same.
  Pick up that book you keep putting off.\nWhat to expect:\n• Uninterrupt
 ed time to read the book you keep meaning to start or finish.\n• A simpl
 e path into conversation\, with no rush and no pressure.\n• A cozy café
  atmosphere that makes it easier to slow down.\n• Proper time offline\, 
 not just "less online."\nWildhearts Cafe is hosting us to support the miss
 ion. Please leave outside drinks and snacks at home and encourage guests t
 o purchase something from the café.\n6:00 to 6:30 pm: Arrive and settle i
 n\n6:30 to 8:00 pm: Quiet reading time\n8:00 to 8:30 pm: Optional connecti
 on time and book swap\n8:30 pm: Wrap-up\nDive into any book. Bring your ow
 n book\, poetry\, essays\, comics\, steamy fan-fic\, whatever holds your a
 ttention.\nAfter reading\, you can talk with others if you feel like it. T
 his is a low-stakes space where saying hello is normal again\, and nobody 
 needs a clever opening line.\nThe book swap is optional. Bring a finished 
 book that is gathering dust and give it a second life. You might go home w
 ith a new read and the quiet satisfaction of passing something along.
