 ude a run-down of the rules for new players or anyone who wants them\, whi
 le those seeking to test their skills will be paired together for a fun ev
 ening of gaming.\nThanks to the generosity of Something in the Water\, we 
 will have several tables to settle in at for the night to play Catan! Tick
 ets for this event are $10.00 or free for Changeling Members\, and include
  access to the gameplay area and on-site game experts who can help you wit
 h player introductions and running how-to-plays for your table. Something 
