  your own spa collection. You’ll explore scent blending\, natural ingred
 ient benefits\, and safe mixing techniques while crafting products designe
 d to nourish the body and calm the mind. Personalize your creations by sel
 ecting your favourite scents\, botanicals\, and finishing touches.\nWhat
 ’s Included:\n• Materials to create a handcrafted soy candle\n• Prem
 ium Ingredients to create a rich\, moisturizing whipped body butter\n• I
 ngredients to make a natural exfoliating body scrub\n• Herbs and botanic
