 e9.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Ten spectacular Audio-Visual (AV) presentations were created f
 or this festival by some of the Toronto Camera Club’s most award-winning
  and talented photographers in this art form.\nThese AV makers are invitin
 g our viewing audience to share in their travel journeys and artistic crea
 tions. Immerse in the vibrant colours of Peru\, relax in the cafes of Pari
 s\, view surreal rock formations from above in Turkey\, and embrace the ru
 gged coastal scenery of Newfoundland. Join two adventures in search of wil
 dlife and landscapes in the southern hemisphere\, one in the barren white 
 expanses of Antarctica\, and the other in the dramatic arid deserts of Nam
 ibia. Marvel at the union of photography and imagination as four of our pr
 esenters share their creative visions with themes of water droplet sculptu
 res\, animated food\, two very mischievous mice\, and the innovation of ar
 tificial intelligence.\nIf you cannot make it in person an Online ticket a
 llows you access from home between April 26-May 3
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/toronto-camera-club-av-festival-2026-tor
 onto/
