  characters\, including a rocking biker (Meat Loaf) and a creepy butler (R
 ichard O’Brien)\, their innocence is slowly surrendered to the hedonisti
 c world they’ve entered. The night gives way to a series of elaborate da
 nces and rock songs culminating in the unveiling of Frank-N-Furter’s lat
