 86.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join community health workers & advocates for a guided convers
 ation about harm reduction.\nHarm reduction is an approach that “meets p
 eople where they are” using evidence-based methods for reducing health r
 isks associated with substance use. *\nOur discussion will cover resources
