DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Mom with a fun hands-on flower arranging\, charm mak
 ing\, and portrait session – all in one blooming weekend.\nDay 1 - April
  25\, 2026\n1:00-3:00 PM | $150.00\nStep into our chapel studio for an aft
 ernoon of flowers\, creativity\, and connection. In this guided floral exp
 erience\, you'll arrange your own bouquet to take home in a ceramic vase. 
 No experience needed\, just an openness to play.\nWe've also set up a char
 m bar where you can craft a meaningful keepsake\, a little something for m
 om\, or a little something for yourself. Stay fuelled and inspired with co
 ffee from Kofi Viet throughout the afternoon.\nThis is a space to slow dow
 n\, make something beautiful\, and share it with the women who matter most
 . Plus a cute studio for great photos!\nAll florals\, ceramic vase\, charm
 s\, and coffee included.\nDay 2 - April 26\, 2026\n10:30 AM - 12:30 PM | $
 90.00 adult\, $10.00 child\nShannon from Ess and Elle will provide a guide
 d workshop to help you improve your photo taking skills\, with just your p
 hone! As a renowed photographer and mother\, she knows you’re always cap
 turing on the go. This session also includes a professional portrait from 
 Shannon.\nAll Materials (photo probs\, coffee and iPhone guide) provided -
  just bring your phone!
LOCATION:Permission Slip Studios
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/in-bloom-mothers-day-workshops-toronto/
