 for anyone caring for babies and children—parents\, grandparents\, babys
 itters\, and caregivers alike. Led by a Certified CPR Instructor\, this ha
 nds-on training equips you with the skills to respond with confidence in c
 ritical moments.\nYou’ll learn how to recognize and respond to breathing
  and cardiac emergencies\, when to call 911\, and what to do while waiting
