 a3.jpg
DESCRIPTION:We are excited to invite you to the spring edition of Queerly 
 Beloved is SATURDAY APRIL 25TH\, 2026 from 11AM-6PM.\n15 Adrian Ave\, vari
 ous studios\nQueerly Beloved is a collaborative marketplace and studio sal
 e that aims to highlight and provide a space for the support Queer-owned s
 mall businesses. QB is hosted by Andréa from Nouveau Riche Vintage at the
  Nouveau studio located at in collaboration with Daniel of Racket Vintage.
  QB showcases curated local artists\, vintage vendors\, entrepreneurs and 
 makers. With a focus on inclusivity\, sustainability\, creativity and mutu
 al aid.\nThis April edition of QB includes a share of 5% of all sales that
  will go to support the Will Munro Fund for Queer and Trans People Living 
 with Cancer. More information about the fund can be found here.\nSpecial G
 uests in Nouveau Studio (Unit 102 ) include House Restora vintage home goo
 ds\, and Fat Chance plus size vintage.\nWe also showcase our studio neighb
 ours including Archival Toronto\, The Peoples Studio ceramic collective\, 
 Bully Boy Lingerie and more!\nEveryone is welcome at Queerly Beloved.\nFre
 e of Charge.\nDonations welcome for refreshments and a hands-on creative b
 utton-making activity\nWe welcome you to come join us next Saturday for gr
 eat vintage \, great company\, creativity and community joy.\nAdrian Ave s
 tudios are located North of Dupont \, of Symimgton Ave. Closest major inte
 rserction is Dupont and Lansdowne\nSee our instagram for map and video dir
 ections
LOCATION:Nouveau Riche Vintage
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/queerly-beloved-vintage-market-and-open-
 studios-toronto/
