 9e.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Looking to enhance your intuitive gifts and connect to your de
 eper self? As part of Toronto's Signs and Seers: Mystic Arts Fair\, Esné 
 - Hypnosis Specialist & Somatic Practitioner -  will guide you through a g
 entle hypnotic journey designed to awaken your natural intuitive abilities
  and strengthen your connection to your true essence.\nIn this circle\, yo
 u’ll explore what it truly means to listen to your intuition and uncover
  how accessing the depths of your subconscious can reveal unexpected insig
 hts and meaningful shifts. Experience how hypnosis can leave you feeling n
 ourished\, illuminated\, and profoundly connected to the mystic within.\n
 ✨ What to Expect\n11:00 – 11:15 | Arrival & Opening\nWarm welcome and 
 gentle introductions\nTime to settle into the space\nIntuitive card pullin
 g to anchor your personal intention\n11:15 – 11:30 | Preparation & Groun
 ding\nIntroduction to hypnosis and what to expect\nGetting comfortable wit
 h pillows\, blankets\, and your space\nGrounding into the body and present
  moment\n11:30 – 12:00 | Guided Hypnotic Journey\nIntention setting with
 in the circle\nA deeply immersive hypnotic experience\nConnecting with int
 uition and inner awareness\n12:00 – 12:20 | Integration & Reflection\nGe
 ntle return to full awareness\nOptional sharing and reflection\n12:20 – 
 12:30 | Closing & Connection\nClosing remarks\nLight mingling and integrat
 ion\nStep into a safe\, nurturing space to explore your intuition\, releas
 e inner blocks\, and connect with the mystic within.\nSpots are limited to
  keep the circle intimate—reserve your place today.
LOCATION:The Plant Mystic
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/finding-the-mystic-within-a-hypnotic-jou
 rney-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
