 lness girl alternative to a boozy brunch.\nWe split into two groups.\n10 A
 M - One group heads to the studio for a 45-minute\, music-driven Pilates c
 lass — strong\, controlled\, all levels.\n11 AM Then we switch.\nSo ever
 yone gets both.\nPickleballers will be split according to experience. Sess
 ions are beginner-friendly\, coached\, social\, easy to learn\, and surpri
 singly addictive.\nAfter? DJ on. Mocktails flowing.\nWellness pop-ups.  A 
 Sunday scene.
