 bes uptown.\nJoin us at Sugar Cafe & Lounge in Richmond Hill for a fun\, l
 ow-pressure social mixer designed for people who just want to get out\, me
 et others\, and actually do something fun.\nNo awkward formats.\nJust a re
 ally good room.\nToronto Event Hub by Andrea Lo has been the one behind To
 ronto Game Night & Toronto Dating Hub and have been hosting game night soc
 ials around the GTA every month for the past 5 years!\n✨ What makes this
