DESCRIPTION:Featured at FanExpo\, Toronto ComiCon\, and the Montreal Fring
 e Festival\, Comedy Game Showdown is Toronto’s longest-running live come
 dy panel show! Each episode\, two teams of Toronto’s finest comedians fa
 ce off in a series of quizzes\, challenges\, and debates to see who will w
 in the game\, and with it…the people’s ovation and fame forever!\nApri
 l 28: Tales of the City (Urban Legend Theme)\nFrom skunk apes to cursed ta
