 gto.com/events/2026/03/23/original_imagee3ed6695-63f1-4922-bf5a-6bb1bc2044
 ce.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Go outside the box at Artbox’s Paint Pouring Workshop and cr
 eate a one-of-a-kind fluid art piece that can never be recreated.\nEnjoy o
 ur vibrant two-level gallery with snacks\, coffee\, and tea before learnin
 g paint pouring techniques such as flip cup\, paint blowing\, intentional 
 pours\, and colour mixing—all guided by our instructor.\nDuration: 1.5
 –2 hours\nIncludes:\n• Choice of 11x14” canvas and/or white fluid be
