 07.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Your eye is your most valuable tool. Sharpen it.\nThe CJA is b
 ringing world-renowned master gem educator Branko Deljanin to Toronto for 
 two days of intensive\, hands-on gemmological training you won't find anyw
 here else in Canada.\nFriday May 1\, 2026\n9:00am – 1:00pm\nIdentificati
 on of Natural and Lab Grown Diamonds\n2:00pm – 6:00pm\nScreening for Tre
 atments in Natural and Lab Grown Diamonds\nSaturday May 2\, 2026\n9:00am 
 – 1:00pm\nIdentification and Screening for Treatments in Corundum\n2:00p
 m – 6:00pm\nIdentification and Screening for Emerald and Jade\nRegister 
 for one session or all four. Walk away with a Reference Booklet and Certif
