 gto.com/events/2026/04/16/original_image3e1defd6-a4ec-4cf7-8459-fd842d71fa
 79.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Inspire your scout’s imaginations with educational play that
  harnesses the limitless creative possibilities of LEGO® bricks. All thro
 ugh May\, scouts in uniform get FREE entry plus 30% off for their friends 
 and family-up to six (6) guests. Purchase in advance to reserve your time 
 slot.\n-To redeem a free scout ticket\, you must purchase a 30% off Friend
 s and Family ticket. It will not allow you to complete the transaction wit
 hout one. There is one free scout ticket per transaction.\n-This offer is 
 valid for youth scouts ages 17 and under.\nAll adults must have a child in
  their party with them for entry. Proof of Scout Membership required (unif
 orm\, vest\, sash\, pin\, badge\, etc.). Tickets are limited and must be b
 ooked online in advance. Only valid May 2026.\nDate and Time: Fri\, 01 May
  2026 10:00 - Sun\, 31 May 2026 17:00\nVenue details: LEGOLAND Discovery C
 entre Toronto\, 1 Bass Pro Mills Drive\, Vaughan\, Ontario\, L4K 5W4\, Can
 ada\nCategory: Attractions\nPrice:\nFriends and Family: CAD 19.59
