 itors from across the GTA to experience the heart of our community.\nThis 
 year’s theme celebrates literacy and book lovers\, guiding you through s
 ome of Bloorcourt’s most charming literary landmarks\, independent books
 hops\, and creative spaces. Along the way\, expect a surprise or two - we 
 always like to keep things interesting!\nCome ready to explore rain or shi
