 gto.com/events/2026/03/26/original_image62d0d4e8-af20-48ca-a6c1-6c53d6e716
 62.jpg
DESCRIPTION:The talented young voices of the Toronto Children's Chorus cel
 ebrate the music and movement from many Asian nations in this engaging con
 cert for the whole family. Enjoy songs from Japan\, Korea\, China\, Singap
 ore\, Malaysia and the Philippines\, featuring traditional instruments and
