 f5.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Look\, we're not famous but we are pretty good.\nAlso we're ti
 red of complicated descriptions so here's why you should come to this show
 :\n-Funny (forget the world for a couple hours)\n-Tickets are as cheap as 
 we could make them (22 bucks plus tax)\n-Guaranteed no A.I (you can see us
