 ty creates genuine comedy superstars)\n-Legendary venue (frequently create
 s aforementioned superstars)\n-Hilarious comedians from every walk of life
  (diverse like our city)\nThanks for reading. Now for the Customer Service
  Voice:\n✅ Upgrade your weekend with a night of laughter at The Melting 
 Pot comedy show!\n💰 Perfect for dates\, anniversaries\, birthdays\, or 
 a just a fun hang at an affordable price\n🔇 Take a break from doomscrol
 ling and enjoy an electric night amongst Toronto's funniest comedians\, fe
 aturing acts seen on Crave\, Netflix\, Prime\, CBC\, Hulu\, Just For Laugh
 s & more ++\n💯 Enjoy a slice of Toronto at a show flexing our cultural 
 prowess\n😈 Content Warning in effect. We get pretty spicy
