 gto.com/events/2026/04/04/original_image55474128-46cd-4ccf-b54e-5ad3cf2558
 fc.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Step into a Golden Age Variety Spectacular where jazz swings\,
  comedy sparkles\, and glamour reigns supreme. Featuring live music\, burl
 esque\, and laugh-out-loud musical comedy\, this show is a loving throwbac
 k to a time when entertainment was bold\, brassy\, and unforgettable. Vaud
 eville is BACK at Theatre 73!\nvaude·ville (noun) : a type of entertainme
 nt popular chiefly in the early 20th century\, featuring a mixture of spec
 ialty acts such as burlesque comedy and song and dance.\nFeaturing: Tom Fi
 nn\, Sweet Rosie Mae\, Rita Ann’tique\, Amy Holden\, Robbie Fenton\, Eli
  Pasic\, Mauranda Izarra & Sean Def\n$35 tickets\nAccessible Theatre\nCaba
