DESCRIPTION:Join the Moose Hide Campaign for the Rally to End Violence on 
 Thursday\, May 14\, 2026 at 12pm in Queen's Park (111 Wellesley St. W.\, T
 oronto ON).\nThis powerful community space is an invitation to individuals
 \, families\, and communities to come together in unity and take a visible
  stand against gender-based violence. It’s a time to raise our voices\, 
 honour our precious ones\, and take steps toward a future free from violen
 ce.\nWe would like to acknowledge the event is being held in the tradition
 al territory of the Anishinaabe\, the Haudenosaunee Confederacy\, and the 
 Wendat Peoples\, and now home to many diverse First Nations\, Inuit\, and 
 Métis peoples.\nThis is a free event and everyone is welcome. Bring your 
 signs\, your drums\, and your commitment to creating safety.\nPlease regis
 ter here to confirm your attendance for Moose Hide Campaign Day: https://m
 oosehide.swoogo.com/2026campaignday
LOCATION:Queen's Park
