 00.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Name of Show : CELEBRASIAN: An Asian Heritage Month Comedy Sho
 w!\nShow Description: Come celebrate Asian Heritage month with some of the
  BEST Stand up comedians in the country. Their parents might be disappoint
 ed in them but you won’t be! Our comics have been on TV! They’ve been 
 viral! They’ve appeared on Just for Laughs\, Roast Battles\, This Hour h
 as 22 Minutes\, TallBoyz\, Crave\, CTV\, CBC and more!\nThis month we feat
 ure CASSIE CAO (JFL\, ROAST BATTLES)\, LEONARD CHAN (JFL\, THIS HOUR HAS 2
