DESCRIPTION:Structured. Balanced. Intentional. 30–50 years old\nCurated 
 Connection is an intentionally designed singles experience for adults 30
 –50 who are serious about building something real.\nThis is a thoughtful
 ly curated room where emotionally aware\, growth-minded adults can connect
  in a way that feels natural\, engaging\, and grounded.\nYou focus on the 
 chemistry — we’ll handle the compatibility. Using our custom matching 
 app\, you’ll be paired with individuals in the room based on lifestyle a
 lignment and shared values 😎.\n💡HOW IT WORKS:\nStep 1️⃣: Purchas
 e a ticket\nStep 2️⃣: Gain access to our matching questionnaire (all p
 arties would have filled out this questionnaire before arrival) 💫\nStep
