 ceive comprehensive\, evidence-based education designed to prepare you to 
 begin supporting women and families with clarity and confidence.\nYou will
  leave grounded in the role of the doula.\nSkilled in foundational support
  techniques.\nReady to take your next steps toward certification and pract
 ice.\nYour Registration Includes\n- 20 hours of live\, instructor-led onli
 ne training\n- A comprehensive digital DONA Postpartum Doula Training Manu
 al\n- Official Certificate of Completion*\n- One month of Yoga Mamas On De
 mand ($20 value)\nOnline Training Schedule (ET)\nFriday\, May 22\n6:00PM 
 – 9:00PM\nSaturday\, May 23\n8:30AM – 5:30PM\nSunday\, May 24\n8:30AM 
 – 5:30PM\nMonday\, May 25\n8:30AM – 5:30PM\nEarly Bird Price (until Ma
 rch 31)\n$649 CAD + HST\nRegular Price\n$699 CAD + HST\nPayment plans are 
 available through Klarna at checkout.\nParticipation Requirements\nFull vi
 deo presence and active participation are required for the entire duration
  of the training.\nThis ensures the integrity of the learning environment 
 and is required for eligibility for a DONA Certificate of Completion.\nPar
 ticipants who are unable to maintain continuous video presence will be rem
 oved from the session and tuition will be forfeited.\nPlease ensure you ha
 ve access to a working computer with a functional camera prior to register
 ing.
