BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Thin Blue Line with Maxim Billig
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260524T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260524T172100
UID:blogto-233637@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/14/original_image135e082a-2c2f-4c07-a2c8-a9fa657bc7
 cf.jpg
DESCRIPTION:100% score on Rotten Tomatoes\nAmong the most important docume
 ntaries ever made\, The Thin Blue Line\, by Errol Morris\, erases the bord
 er between art and activism. A work of meticulous journalism and gripping 
 drama\, it recounts the disturbing tale of Randall Dale Adams\, a drifter 
 who was charged with the murder of a Dallas police officer and sent to dea
 th row\, despite evidence that he did not commit the crime. Incorporating 
 stylized reenactments\, penetrating interviews\, and haunting original mus
 ic by Philip Glass\, Morris uses cinema to build a case forensically while
  effortlessly entertaining his viewers. The Thin Blue Line effected real-w
 orld change\, proving film’s power beyond the shadow of a doubt. Criteri
 on Collection\nFeaturing an introduction by Maxim Billig.
LOCATION:Hot Docs Ted Rogers Cinema
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/the-thin-blue-line-with-maxim-billig-tor
 onto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Toronto Event Hub: Asian Heritage Month Popup Market @ DZO - FREE 
 ENTRY
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260524T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260524T180000
UID:blogto-233404@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/09/original_image658347f8-9813-4ad3-93aa-27a128b052
 6c.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Asian Heritage Month: Support & shop local from Asia
 n vendors\, enjoy Asian food & drinks\, & cute photo opp for all! 1 day on
 ly!\nJoin Toronto Event Hub as we host our 3rd annual Asian Heritage Month
  Popup Market on May 24th at DZO Viet Eatery in Chinatown across the AGO.\
 nCome browse and see what treasures you'll find at our market - support & 
 shop from local Asian-owned businesses\, while enjoying amazing food and d
 rink options. We have giveaways\, live performance(s)\, and a unique photo
  experience\, and so much more.\nMake our market as a stop along your Door
 s Open Toronto tour route as we're right by OCAD and Nathan Phillips Squar
 e.\n***VENDOR APPLICATIONS are currently OPEN - only 10 spots in total! AP
 PLY NOW.*** Successful vendor referrals = extra marketing promotion on our
  online channels (50K exposure).\nWe are also looking for sponsors & cultu
 ral performances.\nFREE admission - everyone is welcome - this is a family
  (and dog)-friendly event.\nThis is a mostly indoor market as we're taking
  over the restaurant - it will happen rain or shine!\nYou have EXTRA chanc
 es to win sweet prizes if you check in to the event with your Eventbrite t
 icket & follow @torontoeventhub on Instagram / Facebook.\nhttps://www.toro
 ntoeventhub.com/events
LOCATION:Dzô Viet Eatery
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/toronto-event-hub-asian-heritage-month-p
 opup-market-dzo-free-entry-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:2nd International Meet and Expo on Renewable and Sustainable Energ
 y
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260525T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260525T183000
UID:blogto-227867@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2025/12/06/original_image1d012990-a58d-4e9f-86eb-c74a11713e
 c8.jpg
DESCRIPTION:It is with great joy and enthusiasm that we extend a warm invi
 tation to participants from around the world to join us for the 2nd Intern
 ational Meet and Expo on Renewable and Sustainable Energy (RENEWABLEMEET20
 26)\, taking place in Rome\, Italy\, from May 25–26\, 2026.\nFollowing t
 he resounding success of RENEWABLEMEET2025\, held in Zurich\, Switzerland\
 , where we were honored to host a distinguished lineup of high-profile spe
 akers\, including leading professors\, CEOs\, researchers\, and industry e
 xperts\, we are thrilled to continue this journey with the next edition of
  the conference.\nThe theme for RENEWABLEMEET2026\, “Empowering a Greene
 r Future through Renewable and Sustainable Energy\,” aims to bring toget
 her visionaries\, innovators\, and scholars from across the globe. This co
 nference will provide a dynamic platform to explore groundbreaking researc
 h and emerging technologies through carefully curated scientific sessions 
 covering Renewable Energy\, Power Energy\, Electrical Energy\, and their r
 eal-world applications in industries\, research institutes\, electronic la
 boratories\, thermal energy plants\, and energy grids.\nThe future of rene
 wable and sustainable energy has never looked brighter. Don’t miss this 
 exceptional opportunity to connect\, collaborate\, and innovate with the g
 lobal energy community.\nWarm regards\,\nR. Shashika\nConference Manager\n
 Organizing Committee\nRENEWABLEMEET2026
LOCATION:Rome\, Italy
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/2nd-international-meet-and-expo-on-renew
 able-and-sustainable-energy-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
