 iences. Guests can sample a wide range of local pours\, discover new favou
 rites\, and connect directly with the people behind the products.\nThe eve
 nt features multiple sessions for every vibe—from a retro-inspired Frida
 y night dance party to daytime family-friendly programming with games\, cr
 afts\, and activities\, and evening live music and disco-themed celebratio
 ns.\nExpect more than just drinks: think grazing gardens\, photo ops\, gia
 nt games\, and a lively community atmosphere built around supporting local
  makers and producers.\nWhether you’re a craft beer enthusiast or just l
 ooking for a fun summer outing\, this festival blends great drinks\, great
